### Example 4: Transaction with Rollback

```csharp
// Start transaction (batch)
undo.BeginBatch();

try
{
    // Perform complex operation
    PerformComplexEdit();

    // Commit transaction
    undo.EndBatch();
}
catch (Exception ex)
{
    // Rollback on error
